# Global ACL file. Applies to EVERY mailbox, before per-mailbox dovecot-acl.
#
# The service account the webmail signs in through must never be constrained
# by ACLs: it authenticates as a Dovecot master user, and when the acl plugin
# treats that session as a non-owner it hides every folder -- which is exactly
# how enabling acl took webmail down on 2026-09-11.
#
# Granting it here covers BOTH possibilities without needing to know which
# identity Dovecot uses for a master session: if the acl username is the
# target mailbox, the owner rules already grant everything; if it is the
# master user, this line does.
* user=jmap_master lrwstipekxa
